{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n こんばんは⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᗜ'๑⃙⃘)⸝\n \n 佐々木のみーぱんです！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ20790ASV2G8CFDCMNGJE0M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n この前、ひよたんとSHOWROOMでスライムを作った時、配信中にとしちゃんが遊んでたんです😘\n \n \n \n その写真がこちら↓\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ207A2XJ8MXM355JVWEFCX5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n スライムを伸ばすとしちゃん。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ207B3RMCDNJ2VKNPF8XYYC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 何かを作ってる（笑）\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ207C8EDPWEW6WK2452M1QZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ207DG7ZT4AXZ1EH8AQYGC1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ207EJJ85VQWZRZ612AD9PY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n びよーーーん。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ207FMFQT3SZK5TAHH6FWZG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ207GMVWBACCYQA1SRJ447W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 結局としちゃん、うどんを作ってました😊\n \n かわいい。\n \n \n \n \n ツインテールしてるからすごい幼く見える👀\n \n 皆さんにプレゼントです🎁\n \n どーぞ。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n よしっ、短いですがこの辺で今日は終わります！\n \n また明日ね〜！！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 🍞佐々木美玲🍞"}],"source":"archive"}